  "worked_solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=sin\u2061x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13933730/assets/96bd60d23237f836b77a26c5c0461a5c2a474554f0a14266b53fc5e7d999f1b7.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n* The domain of the function is $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n* The minimum value is $-1,$ and the maximum value is $1.$ Therefore, the range is $[-1,1].$\n\n* The period of $sin\u2061x$ is $2\\pi .$",
